-- 4. Breakdown — strip rhythm/detail, expose bass structure

-- pull drums and detail
xfadeIn 1 8 $ silence
xfadeIn 2 8 $ silence
xfadeIn 3 8 $ silence
d6 $ silence
d10 $ silence

-- simplified, dark bass
d8 $ bassBreak
d9 $ bassAnchor # gain 0.82 # lpf 240

-- keep sparse harmony/texture (no pads/drones)
d4 $ degradeBy 0.5 $ chordStab # lpf 1200 # gain 0.78
d5 $ spaceTex # gain 0.62
d7 $ burst # gain 0.7

-- rebuild cue
-- d7 $ riser
-- d7 $ silence
